  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation CYBERLAMARR - Promoting Cybersecurity and youth employment in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action intends to address El Salvador&#xbf;s challenges in terms of cybersecurity. It will firstly develop and implement capacity development aiming at young men and women to develop cybersecurity skills. Secondly, the action will promote the development of cybersecurity services in the country&apos;s private sector. The action will be implemented in indirect management with the innovation laboratory of the InterAmerican Development Bank, IDB Lab, which has already been implementing a similar action in Panama with EU private sector partners.Improving the framework for better cybersecurity in El Salvador will have important cross-cutting positive impact on the country&#xbf;s digitalization efforts, currently ongoing with significant EU support.</narrative>
  </description>
